"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-02-05T04:24:40Z","updated_at":"2026-02-05T11:06:31Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.6.stable.official [89cea1439]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable - macOS Tahoe (26.2.0) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M1 Max (Apple7) - Apple M1 Max (10 threads) - 32.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen copying a node with children onto an editable child, the scene tree will show you that children of the source node got copied, when in reality only the parent node gets copied:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bd5cb43c-05a0-40ef-bc6f-eb13b90c4214\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Copy a node that has children <kbd>Ctrl+C</kbd>\n2. Paste it onto an editable child of another scene <kbd>Ctrl+V</kbd>\n3. Save the scene <kbd>Ctrl+S</kbd>\n3. Reload the scene\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25086441/test2.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115894/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115894/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}